      <rules>
        <rule name="Keeper of the Dead" id="142d-4fa1-bb39-156c" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time this unit slays an enemy *infantry* model, select one friendly *vehicle* or *construct* within 6” of this unit. The selected unit regains a point of health it lost earlier in the battle.
In addition, while this unit is within 6” of two or more friendly *vehicles* and constructs it cannot be targeted by ranged attacks or affected by invocations.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
