      <rules>
        <rule name="A Purpose Served In Blood - Command action" id="5646-d0b7-4ccd-7297" hidden="false">
          <description>During the Strategy Phase, a unit with this ability can make this action.
Select one of the following as your priority target:
* Any *Infantry* units with a health characteristic of 2 or less
* Any *Infantry* units with a health characteristic of 3 or more
* Any *Monster* and construct units
Until the end of the turn, when a friendly *Myadea* unit attacks one of your priority targets, add 1 to its attack rolls. Only one friendly unit can make this action each turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
