      <rules>
        <rule name="Vedette Shields" id="5174-f654-d74a-5ee4" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time a hit is inflicted against a friendly unit wholly within 12” of this unit with a ranged weapon, before inflicting damage, roll a dice. On a 9+, that hit is negated.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Electrostatic Aura" id="e5b9-8770-b50c-5b49" hidden="false">
          <description>While an enemy unit is wholly within 12” of one or more models with this rule, it’s *aura* abilities can only affect units within 2”, and any enemy *mystic* units reduce their Arcane characteristic by 1 (to a minimum of 1).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
