        <profile name="Ourokos Excavator" typeId="profile-unit" typeName="Unit" hidden="false" id="98a8-db6e-fcf5-f893">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="char-speed">16</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Health" typeId="char-health">50</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Defence" typeId="char-defence">13</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Initiative" typeId="char-initiative">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Morale" typeId="char-morale">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Arcane" typeId="char-arcane">-</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Macro-Devastator Jaws" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="d845-6aa9-91b4-3d44">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">15</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Seismic Devastator Battery" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="5e6a-087e-33cf-17be">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Each time this weapon inflicts a successful hit on a *vehicle*, *construct*, *monster* or *structure* model, the target model gains a drill point. At the end of the phase, if the target model is not slain, make one attack roll with this weapon for each drill point the target has allocated to it. Damage inflicted by these attacks cannot be allocated to models that do not have drill points allocated to them.
This is a *destroyer* attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="From The Deep" id="ea43-9976-b570-7993" hidden="false">
          <description>If this unit is held in reserve as a *vanguard* unit, after all forces are deployed but before the first turn begins, mark a point on the battlefield as the epicentre. This unit can deploy in any turn after the first with the centre of its base as close to the epicentre as possible.
When this unit deploys, make D10 attack rolls for each other unit within the footprint of its arrival position, with a strength of +5 and a damage of 5, and then move each surviving model the minimum distance required to place the model, more than 1” away from this model. Any units which were displaced within control range of enemy units must be placed in control range of them, and all others must be displaced more than 1” away from enemy units.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Explosive End (Ourokos, 10”)" id="4b3e-fa57-aaed-efeb" hidden="false">
          <description>When this unit is destroyed, before removing the model, roll a dice. On a 5+, it explodes in a 10” blast radius from its base, with a strength of +5 and a damage of 5.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Base 300" id="767e-93a7-3375-7db5" hidden="false" type="profile" targetId="a49d-70d8-ac27-ef9f"/>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
