      <rules>
        <rule name="Demi-Construct" id="ab73-f75a-954a-3c23" hidden="false">
          <description>This unit is never obscured by intervening *infantry* units, but damage from all ranged attacks targeting this unit (except for psychic and destroyer weapons) is reduced by 1.
In addition, this unit may not embark on *transports* or garrison *structures*.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Towering Guardians" id="2e45-d122-713b-db6b" hidden="false">
          <description>While no more than one *independent* unit is grouped with this unit, it always counts as having three or more models for the purpose of being a retinue.
In addition, if this unit is grouped with no other *independent* units, friendly *construct* *leader* units can join this unit as if they were *independent* units.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
