      <rules>
        <rule name="Command Transport" id="10de-a599-0f6b-9e19" hidden="false">
          <description>This transport can carry up to 12 friendly *infantry* models. This unit gains any *aura* and *command* abilities of any units embarked upon this model.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Signal Array" id="5b6e-a0c0-f262-d293" hidden="false">
          <description>When a unit with this ability is on the battlefield, the following rules apply:
* Its controlling player may roll two dice and discard a result of their choice when making rolls to bring in reinforcement warbands.
* Friendly indirect *artillery* attacks made by units within 24” of this unit are not heavily disadvantaged if their target is within line of sight of this unit.
* Friendly visible *vehicle* units (other than Encarii Command Vehicle units) within 18” of a unit with this ability add 1 to their Initiative characteristics.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
