      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d"/>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Khoiata Recurve" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="b74e-6293-d783-4f4c">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">36&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon cannot be used when making a reaction, and cannot target *altitude* units.
If a model equipped with this weapon makes no actions in the movement phase, successful hits made by a model attacking with this weapon can be allocated to models in a target unit by the attacking player, rather than by the target unit’s controlling player (even if models in that unit are already injured). Such attacks can also be allocated to independent units in a group, even if there are three or models in its retinue.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Bladed Talons" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="9f4d-8928-053f-25cf">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">6</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d"/>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Phase Revolver" typeId="f94b-6526-ad27-3051" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="a638-ec03-0934-9a89">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Range" typeId="1023-f0db-ffcf-da31">10&quot;</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="1192-2222-5926-5b4b">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="ff5b-347b-c7f0-5770">+2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="a482-225f-a3cb-a700">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="76cd-5882-86da-52cf">This weapon has a damage characteristic of 2 when targeting a unit within 12” of the attacking model.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Myadea Warblade" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="d23e-965e-ba7f-b484">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d"/>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Electrolance" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="0ba5-90cc-eb9b-288f">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">This weapon has advantage when targeting *monsters* or *cavalry*. If an attack roll of a natural 10 is made with this weapon, the target unit subtracts 1 from its initiative until the following combat phase.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Kastellite Fist" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="15a1-9426-4fe2-61ff">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">3</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">2</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">If, during a Fight action, an attack with this weapon slays one or more *infantry* models, it can throw one of their corpses at another unit. Once this unit has finished all of its attacks, select one enemy unit within 12” as the target.
For each *infantry* model slain by this weapon, make an attack roll with a strength characteristic of +2 and a damage of 2.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Heavy Seismic Pulveriser" typeId="2857-5ab3-db0f-64a1" typeName="Melee Weapon" hidden="false" id="ffd3-8f92-1e35-fce5">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Dice" typeId="e736-f6b3-0474-ddb8">1</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Strength" typeId="9a62-cd45-d844-0bc3">+5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">5</characteristic>
        <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">ach time this weapon inflicts a successful hit on a *vehicle*, *construct*, *monster* or *structure* model, the target gains a seismic shock point. At the end of the phase, if the target model is not slain, make one attack roll with this weapon for each seismic shock point the target has allocated to it. Damage inflicted by these attacks cannot be allocated to models that do not have drill points allocated to them.
This is a *destroyer* attack.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
